{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02414","headline":"秋日应诏 · 袁朗","name":"秋日应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉树凉风举，金塘细草萎。\n叶落商飙观，鸿归明月池。\n迎寒桂酒熟，含露菊花垂。\n一奉章台宴，千秋长愿斯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁朗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}